                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="home-stats__delivered-lane" data-accent="sky">
                    <p class="home-stats__delivered-label"><i class="fas fa-rocket" aria-hidden="true"></i> Growth &amp; ops</p>
                    <div class="home-stats__delivered-tags">
                        <span>Marketing &amp; ad creative</span>
