                    <div class="home-stats__knowhow-tags">
                        <span>Git / GitHub</span><span>GitLab</span><span>Bitbucket</span><span>GitHub Actions</span><span>CI/CD</span><span>npm / yarn</span><span>Postman</span><span>VS Code</span><span>Visual Studio</span><span>dotnet CLI</span><span>cPanel</span><span>DNS / SSL</span><span>Vercel</span><span>Netlify</span><span>Linux basics</span>
